</p> <fw type="sig" place="bottom"> <hi rendition="#aq">III</hi>. 7<lb/>
</fw>
<pb n="98" facs="#f0108"/>
<p>&#x201E;Einer muß doch den Anfang machen!&#x201C; rief &#x017F;ie<lb/>
